---
import SocialLinks from "../components/SocialLinks.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout active="home">
  <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="introduction-title">
    <h1 id="introduction-title" class="sr-only">About Vishwadeep Balakrishnan</h1>

    <div class="intro-copy">
      <p>
        I'm an undergrad studying electrical engineering, and I'm into AI research,
        writing software, and building awesome engineering projects.
      </p>
      <p>My current area of research focuses on Applied AI and VLSI Design.</p>
      <p>
        I also run Speculative Commons, a philanthropy organisation grounded in
        high-risk, high-reward giving, the idea that philanthropic impact follows a
        statistically fat-tailed distribution. Most interventions do little. A small
        number matters enormously. The goal is to find and help fund those before
        consensus.
      </p>
      <p>
        I write Silicon Macro on Substack. A blog covering tech and listed tech
        companies, some global macro, and compute markets.
      </p>
    </div>

    <SocialLinks />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
